ted sealing the Angolmois in capsules, to prevent it from fallling into the wrong hands. Galvatron still has a trick up his sleeve, and threatens to activate a self destruct in his spark. They continue their fight, when Galvatron seriously wounds the Cybertrons. As the Green Warrior, they manage to thrust theor sword into Galvatron which causes a huge explosion. Nemesis is destroyed, along with the Lio Conovy and the rest of his Cybertrons. The survivng Destrons float in space, arguing.","air_date":"1999-01-27","still":null,"runtime":30}]